# Balmor: "Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, creatures you control get +1/+0 and gain trample until end of turn."
# Turn 1 Bot1 casts Balmor and an Elvish Mystic (casting a creature spell does not trigger it: both stay at base power).
# Bot2 has its own Elvish Mystic. On turn 3 Bot1 casts Lightning Bolt at Bot2: the trigger is on the stack above the Bolt, and
# when it resolves Balmor (1 -> 2) and the Mystic (1 -> 2) have trample, while Bot2's Mystic (an opponent's creature) is
# untouched (CR 611.2c). On turn 4 the pump is gone (until end of turn, CR 514.2).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Balmor, Battlemage Captain
Elvish Mystic
Mox Jet
Lightning Bolt
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Elvish Mystic
Island x12

